  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Support to mediation and Disarmament, Demobilisation, Reintegration, and Rehabilitation (DDRR) in the Central African Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the action is to support the peace process in the Central African Republic and address the fragile political and security situation and its consequences for peaceful coexistence through mediation and dialogue support and DDRR support to vulnerable groups including CAAFAG, youth at risk, women ex-combatants, and disarmed groups non-eligible to the official DDRR process.</narrative>
  </description>
